        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおいわを　くだく　キバを　もつ。\nなわばりを　めぐる　オノンドたちの\nあらそいは　ひじょうに　はげしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "큰 바위를 부수는 이빨을 가지고 있다.\n액슨도들의 영역 싸움은\n매우 격렬하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Leurs crocs peuvent découper des rochers.\nLeurs querelles de territoire sont extrêmement\nviolentes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinen Fängen kriegt es sogar Felsen klein.\nGegen Artgenossen, die sein Revier passieren,\ngeht es besonders hart vor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus colmillos pueden hacer añicos rocas inmensas. Las\nluchas territoriales de los Fraxure son encarnizadas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha zanne in grado di frantumare rocce. Le lotte per\nil territorio tra i Fraxure sono furibonde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Their tusks can shatter rocks. Territory battles\nbetween Fraxure can be intensely violent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大岩を　砕く　キバを　持つ。\n縄張りを　巡る　オノンドたちの\n争いは　非常に　激しい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus colmillos pueden hacer añicos rocas inmensas. Las\nluchas territoriales de los Fraxure son encarnizadas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "キバは　にどと　はえかわらないので\nたたかいおわると　かわらの　いわを\nつかって　たんねんに　みがきあげる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "이빨은 다시는 나지 않기 때문에\n싸움이 끝나면 강가에 있는 바위를\n사용해서 정성껏 손질한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comme ses crocs brisés ne repoussent pas, il les\naiguise avec soin après le combat sur les pierres\ndes rivières.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da seine Hauer nicht mehr nachwachsen, wetzt es sie\nnach einem Kampf behutsam an den Felsen eines\nFlussbettes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus colmillos no vuelven a crecer, por lo que, al\ntérmino de cada combate, los afila cuidadosamente\ncon cantos de río.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sue zanne non ricrescono più, per cui finita una\nlotta se ne prende cura e le affila diligentemente\ncon pietre di fiume.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently\nsharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of\na battle.",
